  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759261,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 102 Dalmatiens à la Rescousse, Les (Game Boy Color) - Synopsis\n\nJoin Oddball and Domino, two adventurous Dalmatian puppies, in *102 Dalmatiens à la Rescousse, Les* for the Game Boy Color! When Cruella de Vil's toy sales plummet, she hatches a dastardly plan: reprogram her toys to capture pets and freeze them into \"Super-Gloop\" for a new line of realistic toys. While their parents, Dipstick and Dottie, bravely embark on a rescue mission, Oddball and Domino must stay behind… or so they think!\n\nDriven by a heroic spirit, the puppies set off to save their siblings and parents from Cruella’s clutches. Explore vibrant, beautifully drawn levels inspired by iconic London landmarks like Regent’s Park and Big Ben. Navigate cleverly designed stages, collecting bones, rescuing puppies, and uncovering hidden stickers that piece together a charming sticker book. \n\nThis 2D platform adventure features unique gameplay mechanics, including tumbling to break crates and short-circuiting enemy toys. Discover spirit animal friends who offer guidance and unlock rewarding mini-games. Can you rescue all the Dalmatians and foil Cruella’s evil scheme?"
    },
